                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f5f5f5' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='13'>2. Data Sources and Technical Details</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f5f5f5' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='12'>Data Sources:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#f5f5f5' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='11'>• </run>
